_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOvVwUGguM3vEKJIQ2E_vVz13xA1g_D-QMZhP4Rd7gAeg&oe=6ACCED0C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Augmental Puzzles", "keywords": ["logic", "puzzle", "numbers", "sudoku", "calming"], "long_description": "Master complex puzzles with smart highlighting and intelligent hints.\n\nCorrect mistakes instantly using the infinite undo and replay.\n\nPuzzles crafted by hand, computer verified. Tasty Sourdough-ku!\n\nCheck solutions on the fly to help you solve them with absolute confidence!\n\n{3270784359741014}\n- **Intelligent highlighting** - Making a wrong placement highlights  it, as well as any other number that it clashes with so you can see where the problem lies! \n\n- **Hint System** - We all get stuck sometimes. With our Intelligent Help feature you can get a hint to get you going again.\n\n- **Infinite Undo** - Made a mistake? Not a problem. You can undo it to your heart\u2019s content. Replay allows you to rewatch how you solved the puzzle to learn from your journey.\n\n- **Rules validation** - Making sure you put your numbers correctly according to the sudoku rules.\n\n- **Solution checker** - Checks against the solution for this puzzle. It\u2019s non-intrusive and can be turned off if you\u2019d rather try on your own first.\n\n- **Cloud Save** - Taking a break? Come back and continue your puzzle anytime. There is never any rush with our game.\n\n\n\n# Daily challenges\n{1922426285376151}\nEvery day there is a new sudoku puzzle for you to solve.\n\n\n# Scoring leaderboards\n{4136742409975957}\nFor the competitive puzzlers among us, climb the Daily Challenge Leaderboards.\n\n\n# Handset puzzles\n{1155457683408305}\nAll of our puzzles are handset and come in different sizes!\n", "short_description": "Unwind your mind with Augmental Puzzles, a soothing Puzzle experience designed for daily play. Enjoy a fresh puzzle every day, climb the global leaderboard, and immerse yourself in the quiet satisfaction of logic 